      "text": "If the zeroes of the quadratic polynomial $a x^2 + b x + c \\ (c \\neq 0)$ are equal, then:\r\n(A) $c$ and $a$ have opposite signs\r\n(B) $c$ and $b$ have opposite signs\r\n(C) $c$ and $a$ have the same sign\r\n(D) $c$ and $b$ have the same sign",
