      "ideal_solution": "Equation 1: (a - b)x + (a + b)y = a^2 - 2ab - b^2\r\nEquation 2: (a + b)x + (a + b)y = a^2 + b^2\r\n\r\nSubtract Equation 1 from Equation 2:\r\n[(a + b) - (a - b)]x = (a^2 + b^2) - (a^2 - 2ab - b^2)\r\n2bx = 2ab + 2b^2\r\n2bx = 2b(a + b)\r\nx = a + b.\r\n\r\nSubstitute x = (a + b) into Equation 2:\r\n(a + b)(a + b) + (a + b)y = a^2 + b^2\r\n(a + b)^2 + (a + b)y = a^2 + b^2\r\n(a^2 + 2ab + b^2) + (a + b)y = a^2 + b^2\r\n(a + b)y = -2ab\r\ny = -2ab / (a + b).\r\nSolution: x = a + b, y = -2ab / (a + b).",
