      "text": "Find the sum of all odd integers between $2$ and $100$.",
      "ideal_solution": "The odd integers between $2$ and $100$ are:\r\n$$3, 5, 7, \\dots, 99$$\r\nThis is an A.P. with $a = 3, d = 2,$ and $a_n = 99$.\r\n$$a_n = a + (n - 1)d$$\r\n$$99 = 3 + (n - 1)(2)$$\r\n$$96 = 2(n - 1) \\implies n - 1 = 48 \\implies n = 49.$$\r\n\r\nSum of $49$ terms:\r\n$$S_n = \\frac{n}{2}(a + l)$$\r\n$$S_{49} = \\frac{49}{2}(3 + 99) = \\frac{49}{2} \\times 102 = 49 \\times 51 = 2499.$$",
