      "text": "To conduct Sports Day activities in a rectangular shaped school ground $ABCD$, lines have been drawn with chalk powder at a distance of $1\\text{ m}$ each. $100$ flower pots have been placed at a distance of $1\\text{ m}$ from each other along $AD$. Niharika runs $\\frac{1}{4}^{\\text{th}}$ the distance $AD$ on the 2nd line and posts a green flag. Preet runs $\\frac{1}{5}^{\\text{th}}$ the distance $AD$ on the 8th line and posts a red flag.\r\n(i) Find the coordinates of the green flag ($G$) and the red flag ($R$). (1 Mark)\r\n(ii) What is the distance between both flags? (1.5 Marks)\r\n(iii) If Rashmi has to post a blue flag exactly halfway between the line segment joining the two flags, where should she post it? (1.5 Marks)",
      "ideal_solution": "(i) Total distance $AD = 100\\text{ m}$.\r\n\u2022 Niharika\u2019s position $G$: $x = 2$, $y = \\frac{1}{4} \\times 100 = 25 \\implies G(2, 25)$.\r\n\u2022 Preet\u2019s position $R$: $x = 8$, $y = \\frac{1}{5} \\times 100 = 20 \\implies R(8, 20)$.\r\n\r\n(ii) Distance between $G$ and $R$:\r\n$$GR = \\sqrt{(8 - 2)^2 + (20 - 25)^2} = \\sqrt{6^2 + (-5)^2} = \\sqrt{36 + 25} = \\sqrt{61}\\text{ meters} \\approx 7.81\\text{ m}.$$\r\n\r\n(iii) Halfway position (Midpoint of $GR$):\r\n$$M = \\left(\\frac{x_1 + x_2}{2}, \\frac{y_1 + y_2}{2}\\right) = \\left(\\frac{2 + 8}{2}, \\frac{25 + 20}{2}\\right) = (5, 22.5).$$\r\nRashmi should post the blue flag on the **5th line** at a distance of **$22.5\\text{ m}$**. ",
