      "pyq_year": 2016,
      "pyq_set": "Delhi Set 1",
      "paper_region": "Delhi",
      "marks": 1,
      "text": "The length of the shadow of a tower on the ground is $\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}$ times the height of the tower. What is the angle of elevation of the sun?\r\n(A) $30^\\circ$\r\n(B) $45^\\circ$\r\n(C) $60^\\circ$\r\n(D) $90^\\circ$",
