      "text": "In the figure, $OACB$ is a quadrant of a circle with centre $O$ and radius $3.5\\text{ cm}$. If $OD = 2\\text{ cm}$, find the area of the shaded region. (Take $\\pi = \\frac{22}{7}$)",
