      "text": "What are covalent bonds? Explain why covalent compounds: (i) have low melting and boiling points, (ii) are poor conductors of electricity.",
      "ideal_solution": "1. Definition: Chemical bonds formed by the mutual sharing of valence electron pairs between atoms.\r\n2. (i) Low MP/BP: Intermolecular forces between covalent molecules are weak, requiring minimal thermal energy to overcome during phase changes.\r\n   (ii) Poor Conductivity: Covalent compounds do not form free electrons or ions, so they cannot transport electric charge.",
