      "text": "State Snell's law of refraction. Write the mathematical expression for the refractive index of medium 2 with respect to medium 1 in terms of light velocities.",
      "ideal_solution": "1. Snell's Law: The ratio of the sine of the angle of incidence to the sine of the angle of refraction is a constant for a given pair of optical media: sin(i) / sin(r) = constant.\r\n2. Velocity Relation: n_21 = Speed of light in medium 1 (v1) / Speed of light in medium 2 (v2).",
