      "text": "An object is placed at a distance of 10 cm in front of a convex lens of focal length 15 cm. Find the position, nature, and magnification of the image formed.",
      "ideal_solution": "Given: Convex lens f = +15 cm, object u = -10 cm.\r\nUsing lens formula:\r\n1/v - 1/u = 1/f => 1/v = 1/f + 1/u\r\n1/v = 1/15 + 1/(-10) = 1/15 - 1/10 = (2 - 3)/30 = -1/30.\r\nv = -30 cm.\r\nThe image is formed 30 cm in front of the lens on the same side as the object (virtual and erect).\r\n\r\nMagnification:\r\nm = v / u = (-30) / (-10) = +3.\r\nThe image is virtual, erect, and magnified 3 times.",
