      "ideal_solution": "(a) Magnetic field lines form concentric circular loops centered along the wire axis in perpendicular geometric planes.\r\n(b) (i) Directly proportional to electric current: B proportional to I.\r\n(ii) Inversely proportional to radial distance: B proportional to 1/r.\r\n(c) Right-Hand Thumb Rule: Grip the current-carrying wire with your right hand with the thumb extended in the direction of conventional current; your curled fingers point along the magnetic field loops.",
